        "TileImage": "$($repository 52d3a356-dd04-468f-88ca-7441d9baff1e).Image",
        "Description": "Good afternoon, 47. Unfortunately there remains a plethora of Providence holdout cells across the globe. In particular a group led by Cartegena Manchester, aka The Wright, whose real name is unknown.  One of her associates &quot;Raphael Benitiz&quot;, really just a cover for the notorious death trap inventor Opal Iblis, is posing as an elevator mechanic at this years Global Innovation Race in order to sell illegally harvested organs. Kill him and his client.",
